questions.explanationText:
$$\left| {\matrix{
{a - b - c} & {2a} & {2a} \cr
{2b} & {b - c - a} & {2b} \cr
{2c} & {2c} & {c - a - b} \cr

} } \right|$$

R1 $$ \to $$ R1 + R2 + R3

$$ = \left| {\matrix{
{a + b + c} & {a + b + c} & {a + b + c} \cr
{2b} & {b - c - a} & {2b} \cr
{2c} & {2c} & {c - a - b} \cr

} } \right|$$

$$ = \left( {a + b + c} \right)\left| {\matrix{
1 & 0 & 0 \cr
{2b} & { - \left( {a + b + c} \right)} & 0 \cr
{2c} & {2c} & {c - a - b} \cr

} } \right|$$

$$=$$ (a + b + c) (a + b + c)2

$$ \Rightarrow $$ x $$=$$ $$-$$ 2(a + b + c)

